---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Knock Em Down · Brett Boggs"
  description="Mobile detailing, photographed on location."
>
  <article>
    <header class="page-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Work · 2021 to 2022</p>
      <h1>Knock Em Down</h1>
      <p class="lede">Mobile detailing, photographed on location.</p>
    </header>

    <figure class="bleed">
      <img
        src="/work/ked/estate.webp"
        alt="A black G-Wagon parked on a brick drive in front of a stone estate, headlights on, pink sky behind."
        width="2400"
        height="1600"
        loading="eager"
      />
    </figure>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        Knock Em Down details cars where they sit, in driveways instead of a shop. That is the whole
        pitch, and it only lands if the pictures make the finish look worth paying for.
      </p>
      <p>
        Two shoots. A Panamera taken through a full wash and into golden hour, and a G-Wagon at an
        estate as the light went.
      </p>
    </div>

    <figure class="shot">
      <img src="/work/ked/flare.webp" alt="A white Porsche Panamera being rinsed into the low sun, spray hanging in the light." width="1920" height="1280" loading="lazy" />
    </figure>

    <figure class="shot">
      <img src="/work/ked/foam.webp" alt="The front quarter of the Panamera under a thick coat of white foam." width="1920" height="1280" loading="lazy" />
    </figure>

    <div class="pair">
      <figure class="shot">
        <img src="/work/ked/exhaust.webp" alt="Foam running off a pair of polished exhaust tips." width="1920" height="2880" loading="lazy" />
      </figure>
      <figure class="shot">
        <img src="/work/ked/cloth.webp" alt="Hands working a red cloth over a yellow brake caliper behind the wheel spokes." width="1920" height="2880" loading="lazy" />
      </figure>
    </div>

    <figure class="shot narrow">
      <img src="/work/ked/beading.webp" alt="Water beading across a dark hood while the detailer rinses in the background." width="1920" height="2880" loading="lazy" />
    </figure>

    <figure class="shot">
      <img src="/work/ked/headlight.webp" alt="A clean Panamera headlight, the lens catching an iridescent sheen." width="1920" height="1280" loading="lazy" />
    </figure>

    <figure class="shot">
      <img src="/work/ked/grille.webp" alt="The grille and star of the finished G-Wagon against warm stone." width="1920" height="1280" loading="lazy" />
    </figure>

    <div class="prose">
      <p class="colophon">I also built and ran <a href="https://www.kedservice.com" rel="noopener">the site</a>.</p>
    </div>

    <a class="back-link" href="/work/">All work</a>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .bleed {
    width: 100vw;
    margin: 3rem 0 0 calc(50% - 50vw);
  }
  .bleed img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }
  .shot {
    margin: 3rem 0 0;
  }
  .shot img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border: 2px solid var(--ink);
  }
  .shot.narrow {
    max-width: 34rem;
  }
  .pair {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .pair .shot {
    margin-top: 3rem;
  }
  .colophon {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 2px solid var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .pair {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
